the Term, to provide coverage for at least four (4) years from the occurrence of either such event."}, {"start": 48360, "text": "Metavante currently maintains and, if available at a reasonable cost, Metavante shall continue to pay for, and maintain in full force and effect during the Term insurance as follows:

